                [
                    137.0,
                    771.0
                ]
            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "paragraph_title",
            "block_content": "ARTICLE 8\nPERSONAL LEAVE DAYS",
            "block_bbox": [
                471,
                822,
                752,
                876
            ],
            "block_id": 6,
            "block_order": 7,
            "group_id": 6,
            "block_polygon_points": [
                [
                    471.0,
                    822.0
                ],
                [
                    752.0,
                    822.0
                ],
                [
                    752.0,
                    876.0
                ],
                [
                    471.0,
                    876.0
                ]
            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "paragraph_title",
            "block_content": "Section 1. All permanent full-time employees will be eligible for paid personal leave days as follows:",
            "block_bbox": [
                138,
                903,
                1080,
                959
            ],
            "block_id": 7,
            "block_order": 8,
            "group_id": 7,
            "block_polygon_points": [
                [
                    138.0,
                    903.0
                ],
                [
                    1080.0,
                    903.0
                ],
                [
                    1080.0,
                    959.0
                ],
                [
                    138.0,
                    959.0
                ]
            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "a. One paid personal leave day will be earned in the employee's first calendar year of employment provided the employee has 150 hours (37.5 hour workweek) or 160 hours (40 hour workweek) in an active pay status in the calendar year.",
            "block_bbox": [
                137,
                984,
                1082,
                1068
            ],
            "block_id": 8,
            "block_order": 9,
            "group_id": 8,
            "block_polygon_points": [
                [
                    136.43634033203125,
                    991.004150390625
                ],
                [
                    1081.0,
                    984.0
                ],
                [
                    1081.5634765625,
                    1059.995849609375
                ],
                [
                    136.99981689453125,
                    1067.0
                ]
            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "b. One paid personal leave day per one-half calendar year will be earned in the employee's second calendar year of employment, provided the employee has 150 hours (37.5 hour workweek) or 160 hours (40 hour workweek) in an active pay status in each one-half calendar year.",
            "block_bbox": [
                136,
                1092,
                1086,
                1177
            ],
            "block_id": 9,
            "block_order": 10,
            "group_id": 9,
            "block_polygon_points": [
                [
                    136.0,
                    1092.0
                ],
                [
                    1086.0,
                    1092.0
                ],
                [
                    1086.0,
                    1177.0
                ],
                [
                    136.0,
                    1177.0
                ]
            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "c. In the third and subsequent years of employment, one paid personal leave day per calendar quarter will be earned during the first, third and fourth quarters, provided the employee has 150 hours (37.5 hour workweek) or 160 hours (40 hour workweek) in an active pay status in the first, third, and fourth one-quarter calendar year. Two paid personal leave days shall be earned",
            "block_bbox": [
